  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      260.47,
      401.63,
      285.45
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      295.75,
      401.86,
      321.09
    ],
    "text": "1.(1) This Act may be cited as the Excise (SpecialProvisions) (Amendment) Act, No. of 2011.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      331.75,
      402.39,
      357.09
    ],
    "text": "(2) The provisions of this Act shall for all purposes bedeemed to have come into operation on November 19, 2010.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      367.75,
      402.31,
      465.09
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 5 of the Excise (Special Provisions Act, No. 13of 1989 is hereby amended in sub-paragraph (iii) of paragraph(b) of subsection (2) of that section, by the substitution forthe words \"an amount equal to the total of customs duty,surcharge, cesses, port and airport development levy andvalue added tax\" of the words, \"an amount equal to the totalof customs duty , cesses and port and airport developmentlevy\".",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      475.75,
      402.04,
      501.09
    ],
    "text": "3.In the case of an inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
